  "notes_for_editor": "Thin sources: three pages agree on 1934 and 1947, but none says why the cab was built or abandoned, and neither lookout page documents any staffing, so none is written. Distance: firelookout.com and the Forest Service list both give 20 miles east of Pierce (the list's 'SE of Pierce' rows belong to other lookouts). The Forest Service list was compiled June 2016 and its header cites firelookout.com among its sources, so it is not independent of firelookout.com. Record coordinates were not checked against the legal description. The record's kind 'ground' is not contradicted; the sources say only 'L-4 cab' and 'cabin'. No photo was found. Fact-check 2026-10-10: the 1934 and 1947 dates are now also quoted from Idaho Fire Lookouts (cite 2).",
